    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-2073\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2012/09/lse.jpg\" alt=\"lse\" width=\"414\" height=\"121\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>London is the home of the largest stock exchange in Europe and ranks fourth globally. </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">There are around 3000 listed companies from 60 countries around the world and the judging panel noted that London is particularly strong in emerging markets ETFs.</p>",
